  "prefLabel": "Fis 1002.04 Appreciably jeopardize the continued existence of",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1002.04 “Appreciably jeopardize the continued existence of” means to engage in an action that reasonably would be expected, directly or indirectly, to appreciably reduce the likelihood of both the survival and recovery of a threatened or endangered species’ population by reducing the reproduction, numbers, or distribution of that species.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
